WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
No

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,840
If you had really rushed out just now, you would have died

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,380
And we got away with it

4
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:07,590
on the next road

5
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,630
We won't protect him like you did

6
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,170
in front of life and death

7
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,950
Everyone only cares about themselves

8
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:15,510
If you want your sister to survive, first of all

9
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:16,790
you have to survive on your own

10
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,330
and become stronger and more useful

11
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:21,650
Rather than always thinking about your life as a character who can be sacrificed at any time

12
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:25,250
Is it possible for you to protect his most fundamental capital and not to squander it easily?

13
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:27,550
We need to get out of this area as soon as possible. The smoke may not be a good thing.

14
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,090
But at least it gives us direction

15
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,370
Let's go in the opposite direction of the smoke

16
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:31,390
Or walk sideways

17
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,190
Avoid the route where crazy people gather

18
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:39,870
I understand Qin Shui

19
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:45,250
Do you think the cigarette was made by Yuhui and others?

20
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,640
But it could also be a lunatic trap

21
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,440
If it's really them

22
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:54,180
If we continue to take a detour, will it happen?

23
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:55,720
Take a look with a drone
